{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22869","headline":"寻王道士药堂因有题赠 · 白居易","name":"寻王道士药堂因有题赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行行觅路缘松峤，步步寻花到杏坛。\n白石先生小有洞，黄芽姹女大还丹。\n常悲东郭千家冢，欲乞西山五色丸。\n但恐长生须有籍，仙台试爲检名看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}